  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of the difference in specificity (%) between TBST and IGRA, by test pair: DST 5mm vs QFT 4.50 (−13.13 to 22.12), C-Tb vs QFT 0.70 (−7.02 to 8.42) and C-TST vs T-SPOT.TB 3.54 (−1.37 to 8.44). The overall random-effects pooled difference is 2.29 (−1.60 to 6.18), with confidence intervals crossing zero.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
